# RULES: DOMAIN

## Role

Define data-contract norms: DTO, Entity, Mapper, VO, enum, and serialization.

## What to fill in during synthesis

- contract source of truth (e.g. OpenAPI) and consultation rule;
- DTO ↔ Entity mapping rules;
- naming and IDs (no generic fields);
- centralized validations;
- serialization and sensitive fields;
- exception allowlists, when present (e.g. legacy-ID allowlist).

## Typical triggers

- any change to a DTO, Entity, Mapper, VO, enum, or schema;
- REST integration or external-contract change.
